denotes the number of non-phosphorylation sites of that particular type,
N
is the number of all non- phosphorylation sites, and
P
is the total number of all phosphorylation sites. Enrichment comparisons between phosphorylation sites and non- phosphorylation sites were assessed using the Chi-square test implemented in R 4.3.2.

